  "description": "Wake up to the sea breeze and enjoy a morning walk to the beach from this modern, low-maintenance townhouse in the heart of Shorehaven.<br/><br/>$660 per week | Available 18 October 2026<br/><br/>Enjoy relaxed coastal living in this stylish two-storey townhouse, just a short stroll from Shorehaven Beach. Offering limited ocean views, quality finishes and a low-maintenance lifestyle, this home is ideal for professionals, couples or a small family.<br/><br/>Property Features<br/>2 spacious bedrooms with built-in robes<br/>2 bathrooms plus 3rd toilet upstairs<br/>Open-plan living and dining opening onto a 13m² balcony<br/>Modern kitchen with stone benchtops, breakfast bar, gas cooktop and stainless-steel appliances.<br/>Large fridge recess (1785mm H × 875mm W) suitable for most double-door refrigerators<br/>Near-new Fujitsu reverse-cycle split system air conditioners<br/>Ceiling fans in the living area and second bedroom<br/>Double-glazed windows throughout for comfort and energy efficiency<br/>Instantaneous gas hot water system<br/>Large internal laundry<br/>4.5m² lockable storeroom<br/>Opticomm FTTP high-speed fibre internet<br/>Private rear carport plus ample visitor and street parking<br/>Clothesline<br/>Low-maintenance quiet duplex<br/><br/>Lifestyle & Location<br/>Approx. 450m walk to Shorehaven Beach & Ocean27 Restaurant<br/>Parks, playgrounds and coastal walking paths nearby<br/>Bus stop only 400m away with a direct service to Alkimos Train Station or approximately 7 minutes drive to Alkimos Train Station<br/>Around 45 minutes by train to Perth CBD<br/>Close to shops, schools and everyday amenities<br/>Within the Shorehaven Primary School and Alkimos College catchment areas<br/>Owner-managed property with responsive maintenance.<br/><br/>Lease Details<br/>$660 per week<br/>Bond: $2,640 (4wks)<br/>Available: 18/10/26<br/>6 or 12-month lease<br/>Unfurnished (furnished option may be considered for the right tenants - neg.)<br/>Tenants only pay for water consumption, power and gas as usual.<br/><br/>Applicants MUST view the property to apply, be willing to provide proof of income, rental references and a police check should we request it.",
